<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Endesa cut by First Boston.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Endesa cut by First Boston.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it lowered its rating on Spanish electricity company Empresa Nacional de Electricidad SA (Endesa) to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock was down 2-1/4 to 63-1/2 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
